---
// CtaBanner.astro - High impact call to action banner
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 relative bg-[#05131d] overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <div class="cta-banner-card relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 border-2 border-teal-400/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0c2e42] via-[#082233] to-[#04121b] shadow-2xl shadow-teal-950/60">
      
      <!-- Background Ambient Glow & Volleyball Watermark -->
      <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-96 h-96 bg-teal-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute right-6 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-5 pointer-events-none hidden lg:block">
        <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="" class="w-96 h-96" />
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500/20 border border-teal-400/40 text-teal-300 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-400 animate-ping"></span>
          <span>Matrículas Abiertas • Turnos Mañana, Tarde & Noche</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black uppercase text-white leading-[0.95] mb-6">
          Tu lugar en la cancha <br />
          <span class="text-gradient">te está esperando</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-slate-200 text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl font-normal leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl">
          No dejes pasar la oportunidad de entrenar vóley con la mejor metodología, en una sede de primer nivel en Jesús María y con un equipo que te apoyará en cada jugada.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4">
          <button 
            data-open-modal
            class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 via-teal-400 to-emerald-400 text-[#05131d] font-black text-sm uppercase tracking-wider hover:from-teal-400 hover:to-emerald-300 transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl shadow-teal-500/30 hover:shadow-teal-400/50 hover:scale-105 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center gap-3"
          >
            <span>Inscribirme Ahora</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </button>

          <a 
            href="https://wa.me/51979833360?text=%C2%A1Hola%20Domus%20Voleibol%20Club!%20Quiero%20solicitar%20informaci%C3%B3n%20sobre%20las%20clases%20de%20v%C3%B3ley." 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto px-7 py-4 rounded-xl card-glass border border-teal-500/30 text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider hover:border-teal-400 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.587-5.946.003-6.556 5.338-11.891 11.893-11.891 3.181.001 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.48 8.414-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892-1.99-.001-3.951-.5-5.688-1.448l-6.305 1.654zm6.597-3.807c1.676.995 3.276 1.591 5.392 1.592 5.448 0 9.886-4.434 9.889-9.885.002-5.462-4.415-9.89-9.881-9.892-5.452 0-9.887 4.434-9.889 9.884-.001 2.225.651 3.891 1.746 5.634l-.999 3.648 3.742-.981zm11.387-5.464c-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347-.297-.149-1.758-.868-2.031-.967-.272-.099-.47-.149-.669.149-.198.297-.768.967-.941 1.165-.173.198-.347.223-.644.074-.297-.149-1.255-.462-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.297-.347.446-.521.151-.172.2-.296.3-.495.099-.198.05-.372-.025-.521-.075-.148-.669-1.611-.916-2.206-.242-.579-.487-.501-.669-.51l-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372s-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 1.065 2.876 1.213 3.074c.149.198 2.095 3.2 5.076 4.487.709.306 1.263.489 1.694.626.712.226 1.36.194 1.872.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.695.248-1.29.173-1.414z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Escribir al WhatsApp: 979 833 360</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
